WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.667
- [Kelly] Nice to see you in person.

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.500
- Yeah.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.333
- [Kelly] Nice to see you again.

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:04.166
- Much nicer isn't it, to do it in person?

00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:05.790
- [Kelly] Yes, it's a little less awkward.

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:06.940
How are your girls?

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.200
- They're great, yeah.
- Yeah?

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.371
- I'm missing them at the moment.

00:00:09.371 --> 00:00:12.592
I've been away from them for 10 days

00:00:12.592 --> 00:00:13.467
- [Kelly] Oh

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:14.710
- And we have like, a two week rule.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:15.740
- I was gonna say, do you have a rule?

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.573
- Yeah, yeah. Two weeks.

00:00:16.573 --> 00:00:19.460
I've only broken it once,
so I get back just in time.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.020
So, yeah.
- [Kelly] Yeah

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.590
Do they still think of
you as like a funny dad,

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:23.423
like a cool dad?

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:25.320
Or are you kind of annoying?
Have you gotten to that stage?

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.770
- I'm not sure. You know, I
guess cause we've had three,

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:31.000
so you get three chances
at like, trying to continue

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.620
the idea that you're funny.

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:33.453
- [Kelly] Yeah, that you're cool.

00:00:33.453 --> 00:00:36.070
- So you try all the same
material out with each one.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:37.300
My, my whole thing is...

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.820
which worked when they
were at a particular age,

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:41.830
and now it doesn't work at all,

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:44.250
is I can't be around a
banana and not pick it up

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.513
and go, "hello?"
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:00:45.513 --> 00:00:47.746
Like, it's not remotely funny,

00:00:47.746 --> 00:00:48.579
- It's kind of funny

00:00:48.579 --> 00:00:49.412
- But I'm- it's not, no

00:00:49.412 --> 00:00:51.490
- I'm 39 and I am gonna do it tonight.

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:54.070
- But listen, I'm 39 too,
listen, it won't work.

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:55.339
What age are your kids?
They won't find it funny.

00:00:55.339 --> 00:00:58.290
- Well, it will work for- my
son will laugh. He's five.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.560
- Yeah, our five-year-old started

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:00.900
rolling her eyes at it for me.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.359
- Boys are a little- they advance slower.

00:01:02.359 --> 00:01:03.192
- [Jamie] Yeah.

00:01:03.192 --> 00:01:04.025
- He's gonna laugh.

